+# Docker Auto-Update
+
+Automatic update mechanism for Coding Plan Gateway Docker containers. Checks for new commits on startup, pulls updates, rebuilds, and restarts the service.
+
+## Overview
+
+The auto-update system uses a shell-based entrypoint script that orchestrates:
+
+1. **Update Detection**: Compares local and remote git commits
+2. **Code Fetch**: Pulls latest code using HTTPS or SSH authentication
+3. **Build Process**: Runs `npm ci` and `npm run build`
+4. **Atomic Swap**: Swaps builds atomically to minimize downtime
+5. **Health Verification**: Verifies service health before confirming success
+6. **Rollback**: Automatic rollback on build or startup failure
+
+## Architecture
+
+```
+┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
+│                    Docker Container                          │
+│                                                              │
+│  ┌─────────────────┐    ┌──────────────────┐                │
+│  │   entrypoint.sh │───►│  Update Check     │                │
+│  │   (orchestrator)│    │  - git ls-remote  │                │
+│  └────────┬────────┘    │  - compare commit │                │
+│           │             └─────────┬──────────┘                │
+│           │                       │                          │
+│           │           ┌───────────▼───────────┐              │
+│           │           │      No Update       │               │
+│           │           │  → Start existing    │               │
+│           │           └─────────┬───────────┘                │
+│           │                     │                            │
+│           │           ┌─────────▼──────────┐                 │
+│           │           │    Update Found    │                 │
+│           │           │  → git fetch       │                 │
+│           │           │  → npm ci          │                 │
+│           │           │  → npm run build   │                 │
+│           │           └─────────┬──────────┘                 │
+│           │                     │                            │
+│           │           ┌─────────▼──────────┐                 │
+│           └──────────►│   Build Success    │                 │
+│                       │  → Backup old      │                 │
+│                       │  → Swap builds     │                 │
+│                       │  → Start service   │                 │
+│                       └──────────────────┘                  │
+│                                                              │
+│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐       │
+│  │  Error Handling (any stage)                      │       │
+│  │  → Log error details                             │       │
+│  │  → Restore backup if exists                      │       │
+│  │  → Start with last known good build              │       │
+│  │  → Retry with exponential backoff                │       │
+│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘       │
+└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
+```
+
+## Quick Start
+
+### 1. Build the Image
+
+```bash
+docker build -f docker/autoupdate/Dockerfile.autoupdate -t cpg:autoupdate .
+```
+
+### 2. Run with HTTPS Authentication
+
+```bash
+docker run -d \
+  --name cpg-gateway \
+  -e AUTOUPDATE_GIT_URL=https://github.com/your-org/coding-plan-gateway.git \
+  -e AUTOUPDATE_GIT_TOKEN=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx \
+  -e AUTOUPDATE_BRANCH=master \
+  -p 8080:8080 \
+  -v $(pwd)/config.yaml:/app/config.yaml:ro \
+  cpg:autoupdate
+```
+
+### 3. Run with SSH Authentication
+
+```bash
+docker run -d \
+  --name cpg-gateway \
+  -e AUTOUPDATE_GIT_URL=git@github.com:your-org/coding-plan-gateway.git \
+  -e AUTOUPDATE_SSH_KEY_PATH=/root/.ssh/id_rsa \
+  -v ~/.ssh/id_rsa:/root/.ssh/id_rsa:ro \
+  -p 8080:8080 \
+  -v $(pwd)/config.yaml:/app/config.yaml:ro \
+  cpg:autoupdate
+```
+
+## Configuration
+
+### Environment Variables
+
+| Variable | Default | Description |
+|----------|---------|-------------|
+| `AUTOUPDATE_ENABLED` | `true` | Enable/disable auto-update |
+| `AUTOUPDATE_BRANCH` | `master` | Git branch to track |
+| `AUTOUPDATE_GIT_URL` | - | Git repository URL (required) |
+| `AUTOUPDATE_GIT_TOKEN` | - | HTTPS authentication token |
+| `AUTOUPDATE_SSH_KEY_PATH` | `/root/.ssh/id_rsa` | SSH key path |
+| `AUTOUPDATE_MAX_RETRIES` | `3` | Maximum retry attempts |
+| `AUTOUPDATE_BACKUP_ENABLED` | `true` | Enable build backup |
+| `AUTOUPDATE_HEALTH_URL` | `http://localhost:8080/health` | Health check URL |
+| `AUTOUPDATE_CHECK_INTERVAL` | `0` | Periodic check interval (seconds, 0=startup only) |
+| `LOG_LEVEL` | `info` | Log level: debug, info, warn, error |
+
+### Authentication
+
+#### HTTPS with Token (Recommended for CI/CD)
+
+Set `AUTOUPDATE_GIT_TOKEN` to a personal access token or OAuth token:
+
+```bash
+# GitHub
+echo "ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
+
+# GitLab
+echo "glpat-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
+```
+
+Token must have `repo` (GitHub) or `read_repository` (GitLab) scope.
+
+#### SSH Key (Recommended for Production)
+
+1. Generate an SSH key (if not exists):
+   ```bash
+   ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C "cpg-autoupdate" -f ~/.ssh/cpg_autoupdate
+   ```
+
+2. Add public key to repository deploy keys:
+   ```bash
+   cat ~/.ssh/cpg_autoupdate.pub
+   # Copy output to GitHub/GitLab deploy keys
+   ```
+
+3. Mount key as volume:
+   ```bash
+   -v ~/.ssh/cpg_autoupdate:/root/.ssh/id_rsa:ro
+   ```
+
+## Manual Operations
+
+### Trigger Manual Update
+
+Send SIGUSR1 signal to trigger update check:
+
+```bash
+# Using Docker
+docker kill --signal=SIGUSR1 cpg-gateway
+
+# Using autoupdate-check script
+./scripts/autoupdate-check.sh cpg-gateway
+
+# Wait for completion with verbose output
+./scripts/autoupdate-check.sh -v -w -t 60 cpg-gateway
+```
+
+### Check Status
+
+```bash
+docker exec cpg-gateway /app/entrypoint.sh status
+```
+
+### Force Rollback
+
+```bash
+docker exec cpg-gateway /app/entrypoint.sh rollback
+```
+
+### View Logs
+
+```bash
+# Follow logs
+docker logs -f cpg-gateway
+
+# Recent update-related logs
+docker logs cpg-gateway 2>&1 | grep -E "(UPDATE_|SERVICE_)"
+```
+
+## Docker Compose Examples
+
+See [examples/](examples/) directory for complete examples:
+
+- `docker-compose.https.yml` - HTTPS token authentication
+- `docker-compose.ssh.yml` - SSH key authentication
+
+## Troubleshooting
+
+### Authentication Failed
+
+**Symptoms**: `UPDATE_ERROR` with authentication-related messages
+
+**Solutions**:
+1. Verify token/key has read access to repository
+2. Check token hasn't expired
+3. For SSH: ensure key is mounted at correct path
+4. For HTTPS: verify token format (should not include username)
+
+### Network Timeout
+
+**Symptoms**: `UPDATE_ERROR` with timeout messages
+
+**Solutions**:
+1. Check container has internet access
+2. Verify Git host is reachable: `docker exec cpg-gateway curl -I https://github.com`
+3. Increase timeout: `AUTOUPDATE_GIT_TIMEOUT=60`
+4. Check for proxy requirements
+
+### Build Fails
+
+**Symptoms**: `UPDATE_BUILD_FAILED` or validation errors
+
+**Solutions**:
+1. Check build works locally: `npm run build`
+2. Verify all dependencies in `package.json`
+3. Check Node.js version compatibility
+4. Review build logs: `docker logs cpg-gateway 2>&1 | grep -A 10 "UPDATE_BUILD"`
+
+### Service Doesn't Start
+
+**Symptoms**: Container exits immediately or health check fails
+
+**Solutions**:
+1. Check logs: `docker logs cpg-gateway`
+2. Verify `config.yaml` is mounted correctly
+3. Check port availability: `docker exec cpg-gateway netstat -tlnp`
+4. Ensure rollback marker not stuck: `rm /data/rollback-needed`
+
+### Rollback Loop
+
+**Symptoms**: Container continuously rolls back
+
+**Solutions**:
+1. Check for rollback marker: `docker exec cpg-gateway ls -la /data/`
+2. Clear marker if stuck: `docker exec cpg-gateway rm -f /data/rollback-needed`
+3. Check if new build is actually broken
+4. Review health endpoint configuration
+
+## File Structure
+
+```
+docker/autoupdate/
+├── entrypoint.sh              # Main orchestration script
+├── lib/
+│   ├── logging.sh             # Structured JSON logging
+│   ├── git.sh                 # Git operations (HTTPS/SSH)
+│   ├── build.sh               # npm ci/build automation
+│   ├── health.sh              # Health check verification
+│   └── rollback.sh            # Backup and rollback logic
+├── Dockerfile.autoupdate      # Extended production image
+├── README.md                  # This file
+└── examples/
+    ├── docker-compose.https.yml
+    └── docker-compose.ssh.yml
+
+scripts/
+└── autoupdate-check.sh        # CLI trigger script
+```
+
+## Security Considerations
+
+1. **Never log tokens**: Tokens are sanitized before logging
+2. **SSH key permissions**: Keys are set to 0600 on mount
+3. **Build isolation**: Builds happen in temporary directory before swap
+4. **No secrets in images**: Use environment variables or mounts
+5. **Read-only mounts**: Config files mounted as read-only
+
+## Performance
+
+- **Startup (no update)**: < 30 seconds
+- **Full update cycle**: < 2 minutes
+- **Health check interval**: 2 seconds
+- **Rollback time**: < 10 seconds
+- **Disk usage**: Current build + 1 backup
+
+## Integration Testing
+
+See the E2E test specification for integration testing details.
+
+## License
+
+Same as the Coding Plan Gateway project.
